  "releaseNotes": "NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Providers.FirebaseOASIS v2.0.3\n\nConnects the OASIS to Google Firebase Realtime Database using the Firebase REST API. Stores OASIS holons and avatars as JSON documents. No Firebase SDK required — uses System.Net.Http. Part of the OASIS HOT-Swappable Provider Architecture. Ecosystem: https://oasisomniverse.one\n\nWhat's new since v2.0.2\n- fix: preserve Firebase REST read failures and validate collection payloads (78474d5)\n- Integrate verified Firebase RTDB native storage lifecycle (2b84863)\n- MOVING DOCS AROUND (32a8004)\n- Restore Firebase bounded CQL and canonical save acknowledgement demo (54649c2)\n- Validate GUID native keys before avatar deletion in forty adapters (597758b)\n\nFull changelog\nhttps://github.com/NextGenSoftwareUK/OASIS/commits/master/Providers/Cloud/NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Providers.FirebaseOASIS",
